<h1>Data Deletion Instructions</h1>

<p>
  Last updated:
  <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
    year: 'numeric',
    month: 'long',
    day: 'numeric'
  }) %>
</p>

<p>
  FLICKCANVAS does not require visitors to create an account
  or provide personal information to browse movie content on
  our website.
</p>

<p>
  We do not intentionally collect or store personal information
  from visitors through our Facebook, Instagram, or Pinterest
  integrations.
</p>

<h2>What Data We Process</h2>

<p>
  Our Facebook and Instagram integrations are used to publish
  movie-related content, such as movie posters, titles,
  ratings, descriptions, trailers, and links, to our official
  social media accounts.
</p>

<p>
  Our Pinterest integration may be used to create and publish
  movie-related Pins to our official Pinterest Business account.
</p>

<p>
  These integrations are used for publishing and managing our
  own social media content. We do not intentionally collect or
  store personal information belonging to Facebook, Instagram,
  or Pinterest users through these integrations.
</p>

<h2>Requesting Data Deletion</h2>

<p>
  Because FLICKCANVAS does not intentionally store personal
  information from visitors or social media users, there is
  normally no personal data associated with a user that needs
  to be deleted.
</p>

<p>
  However, if you believe that FLICKCANVAS may have received
  or stored personal information relating to you and you would
  like that information deleted, you may contact us using the
  email address below.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>flickcanvasmovies@gmail.com</strong>
</p>

<p>
  Please include enough information for us to understand your
  request. We will review valid requests and take appropriate
  action in accordance with applicable laws and our data
  retention requirements.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Platforms</h2>

<p>
  Facebook, Instagram, and Pinterest are independent third-party
  platforms. If you want to delete information held by those
  platforms, you may also need to use their respective privacy
  and account-management tools.
</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<p>
  If you have any questions regarding data deletion, please
  contact us at:
</p>

<p>
  <strong>flickcanvasmovies@gmail.com</strong>
</p>
